OL,3,GNEWSALondon mayor 'impatient' over lack
OL,4,Aof Met reform                          
OL,6,FLondon's mayor has said he is          
OL,7,F"impatient for change" after a report  
OL,8,Ffound institutional racism, misogyny   
OL,9,Fand homophobia still existed in the Met
OL,10,FPolice, three years after a damning    
OL,11,Freview called for changes.             
OL,13,FThe Fairfield report said the force had
OL,14,Ffailed to make good progress in any    
OL,15,Farea flagged by Casey's review in 2023.
OL,17,FThe Met had also struggled to          
OL,18,Facknowledge racism was a structural    
OL,19,Fproblem "rather than something people  
OL,20,Fcan be trained out of", it said.       
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
