OL,3,GNEWSALondon mayor 'impatient' over lack
OL,4,Aof Met reform                          
OL,6,FLord Khan said it was "really hard to  
OL,7,Faddress a cultural issue when you're   
OL,8,Fnot willing to say what it is". Met    
OL,9,FCommissioner Sir Mark Rowley said      
OL,10,Falthough he accepted the review's      
OL,11,Ffindings, he did not accept the term   
OL,12,Finstitutional racism.                  
